---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTABand from '../components/CTABand.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Buying Agent for NRIs Buying UK Property | Salet"
  description="You live and work in the UK. Buying property here is still a foreign process. Salet gives NRIs buyer-only representation: search, analysis, negotiation and completion, handled."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="For UK-based NRIs"
    title="You live here. The property process still treats you like a stranger."
    lede="You have the deposit and the intent. Salet brings the process fluency, and an agent on your side."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="prose-salet lg:col-span-7">
        <h2>The problem is not effort. It is asymmetry.</h2>
        <p>
          Every agent you meet works for the seller. You are buying against professionals, in spare evenings.
        </p>
        <h2>What working with Salet looks like</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>A written brief</strong> before anything else.</li>
          <li><strong>The whole market searched</strong>, including off-market homes.</li>
          <li><strong>Analysis before viewings.</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Negotiation by your representative.</strong></li>
          <li><strong>Progression to completion.</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Fees: a retainer, deducted in full from a success fee due only at exchange.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="reveal border border-line bg-ivory-2/60 p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-green-2">A good fit if</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone">
            <li>You are buying at £250,000 or above</li>
            <li>Funds in place or a mortgage agreed in principle</li>
            <li>You want to buy within 12 months</li>
            <li>You value your evenings and weekends</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-mist">
            We represent you, the buyer, and nothing else.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABand
    title="Talk it through first"
    body="30 minutes. Bring your brief, however rough."
  />
</Base>
